<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VII__cl_30__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Any directive, order or decision made by the existing Anti-Smuggling Unit and in force immediately before the commencement of this Act shall, upon the commencement of this Act, so far as it is consistent with this Act, continue to remain in force until it is revoked by the Agency."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@> .
