<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_11__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_11> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@> .
